{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>When it grazes.</b> This too is connected, since above he mentioned that damage may come by means of the ox, and he says כי יבער איש from the root אנחנו ובעירנו (Numbers 22), and it is from the binyan with a dagesh." "<b>And the sense of and it grazes in another field.</b> Another person's field, and likewise ואתם בערתם הכרם (Isaiah 3:14)."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {0 "The verse citation (במד' כ) seems to refer to Numbers 22, but the form ובעירנו appears in Numbers 22:4; resolved accordingly."}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:37:18.936158469Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}